- Only 30 videos: small benchmark.
- Domain imbalance: Math only 4 videos.
- YouTube chapters are creator-provided, not perfect human lab annotations.
- Public YouTube lecture styles vary: slides, whiteboard, chalkboard, talking head.
- ASR can struggle with math notation and technical terms.

Evidence: `thesis/chapters/chapter5_conclusion.tex`, `docs/DOMAIN_PERFORMANCE.md`

